# 'Nothing gated' (docs/squeeze.md): the crew van from the park to bart_16th by street (201 m), the driving autopilot on the
# sim's own traffic network (tools/squeeze/routes.ts writes this file). The van must arrive within 25 m of the route's end.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 57.5 -17.8 -1.1 270
tap use 30
bot drive 57.5,-15.6 53.1,-34.2 55.1,-63.0 57.2,-91.8 58.5,-120.0 60.3,-147.9 72.1,-167.1 94.7,-165.3 94.7,-165.3 from 100 speed 8 corner 4 stop
run 13218
expect skater.pos.x > 69.7 at 13218
expect skater.pos.x < 119.7 at 13218
expect skater.pos.y > -190.3 at 13218
expect skater.pos.y < -140.3 at 13218
